   "source": [
    "Since my research question is about daily electricity demand, I merged the data by date instead of the full timestamp. The time of day isn't relevant to my question as I care about how a whole day's weather relates to that day's demand, not how demand changes hour to hour. \n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "When aggregating to a daily level, I summarised each feature by the statistic most relevant to demand — taking the daily maximum for temperature and demand (since peaks drive grid stress) and the daily mean for humidity, wind, and pressure (which affect demand through sustained conditions rather than momentary extremes)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 45,
   "id": "21f3d363-66c3-405f-92f3-daaa5d616f8f",
   "metadata": {},
